@startuml
title Despliegue IT ZENIT Tag Listener (On-Prem + Cloud)

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowThickness 1
skinparam linetype ortho


node "Servidor Local Mina\nLinux" as localhost {
node "Servidor Local Mina\nLinux" as tmone.denial.cl {
  node "Docker Engine" as LocalDocker {
    component "zenit-listener\n(TCP + GUI)" as LocalListener
    component "backend-api\n(REST/gRPC)" as LocalBackend
    database "PostgreSQL\nBD ZENIT Local" as LocalDB
  }
}

node "Servidor Cloud\nAWS / GCP\nLinux" as CloudHost {
  node "Docker Engine" as CloudDocker {
    component "zenit-listener\n(TCP + GUI)" as CloudListener
    component "backend-api\n(REST/gRPC)" as CloudBackend
    database "PostgreSQL\nBD ZENIT Cloud" as CloudDB
  }
}

cloud "Backbone Mina / RPi\n(cable radiante)" as BackboneNet
cloud "Red IP\nLAN / Internet" as IpNet

BackboneNet --> IpNet : TCP 7070\ntramas tag
IpNet --> LocalListener : opcion On-Prem
IpNet --> CloudListener : opcion Cloud

LocalListener --> LocalBackend : HTTP/REST\npuerto 8000
CloudListener --> CloudBackend : HTTP/REST\npuerto 8000

LocalBackend --> LocalDB : PostgreSQL 5432
CloudBackend --> CloudDB : PostgreSQL 5432

@enduml